# SDLC Artifacts Directory

This directory contains the output from each SDLC agent:

1. **{story-id}-requirements.md** - Requirements analysis
2. **{story-id}-architecture.md** - Solution architecture
3. **{story-id}-design-review.md** - Design review findings
4. **{story-id}-impl-plan.md** - Implementation plan
5. **{story-id}-code-review.md** - Code review report
6. **{story-id}-verification.md** - Verification and test results
7. **{story-id}-pr-description.md** - Pull request description

Each file is generated by its corresponding agent during the SDLC orchestration process.
